\section{Extended Training Dynamics}
\label{sec:appendix_extended}

See Figure~\ref{fig:extended_training} in the main text for the 300-step extended training results.
At 300 steps, GSM8K accuracy: CKA-only 64.37\% (identical to 100-step seed 42), Standard 59.29\% (within 100-step seed variance of $\pm$0.38\,pp).
